          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><hr />\n<h2 id=\"workspace-file-tree-bug\">\ud83c\udfaf \u5be6\u6230\u6848\u4f8b\u5be9\u67e5\uff1aWorkspace-File-Tree \u522a\u9664\u529f\u80fd\u771f\u5be6 Bug \u5256\u6790</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>\u9a57\u8b49\u76ee\u6a19</strong>\uff1a\u6aa2\u9a57 <code>workspace-file-tree</code> \u5728\u65b0\u589e\u56de\u6536\u6876\u522a\u9664\u529f\u80fd\u6642\u7684\u5169\u6b21\u9023\u7e8c Commit\uff1a\n1. <code>df3cc5f</code> (Buggy Commit\uff1a\u65b0\u589e\u522a\u9664\u6309\u9215\u4f46\u5b58\u5728\u81f4\u547d\u7f3a\u9677)\n2. <code>a1995e4</code> (Fix Commit\uff1a\u4fee\u5fa9\u4f5c\u7528\u57df\u4e26\u66ff\u63db\u70ba In-DOM Modal)</span>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"buggy-commit-df3cc5f\">\ud83d\udca5 Buggy Commit (<code>df3cc5f</code>) \u73fe\u5834\u9084\u539f</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>\u7f3a\u9677 1\uff1a\u8a5e\u6cd5\u4f5c\u7528\u57df\u56da\u7981 (Lexical Scope Trap) \u2794 <code>ReferenceError</code> \u5d29\u6f70</strong><ul>\n<li>\u63a5\u7dda\u8655\uff1a\u5728\u9802\u5c64\u6a21\u7d44\u51fd\u5f0f <code>createTreeNode()</code> \u5167\u70ba\u6309\u9215\u639b\u4e0a\u76e3\u807d\uff1a<code>btnDelete.addEventListener('click', async () =&gt; await deleteItemToRecycleBin(item, wrapper))</code>\u3002</li>\n<li>\u5ba3\u544a\u8655\uff1a<code>deleteItemToRecycleBin</code> \u537b\u88ab\u5ba3\u544a\u5728\u7b2c 860 \u884c <code>async function init()</code> \u7684<strong>\u5167\u90e8\u9589\u5305</strong>\u4e2d\uff01</li>\n<li>\u7d50\u679c\uff1a\u57f7\u884c\u671f\u9ede\u64ca\u6309\u9215\u6642\uff0c\u5916\u5c64\u627e\u4e0d\u5230\u5167\u5c64\u9589\u5305\uff0c\u76f4\u63a5\u62cb\u51fa <code>ReferenceError: deleteItemToRecycleBin is not defined</code>\u3002</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>\u7f3a\u9677 2\uff1aWebview \u7981\u5fcc\u963b\u585e API (Hazardous Blocking Dialog) \u2794 UI \u51cd\u7d50\u6216\u7121\u6548</strong><ul>\n<li>\u4f7f\u7528\u4e86\u539f\u751f\u7684 <code>window.confirm(...)</code>\u3002</li>\n<li>\u5728 VS Code / Antigravity Webview \u6c99\u76d2\u74b0\u5883\u4e0b\uff0c\u540c\u6b65\u963b\u585e\u5c0d\u8a71\u6846\u6703\u5361\u6b7b\u4e8b\u4ef6\u8ff4\u5708\u6216\u88ab Chromium \u975c\u97f3\u541e\u6389\u3002</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"uia-code\">\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f UIA-CODE \u8a9e\u610f\u6a39\u5dee\u5206\u6aa2\u6e2c\u80fd\u529b</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>\u50b3\u7d71 AST / Regex \u76f2\u9ede</strong>\uff1a\u770b\u5230\u6709\u5beb <code>addEventListener</code> \u5c31\u8aa4\u5224\u70ba <code>READY_TO_SHIP</code>\uff08\u7d66\u51fa\u865b\u5047\u5b89\u5168\u611f\uff09\u3002</li>\n<li><strong>UIA \u4f5c\u7528\u57df\u53ef\u9054\u6027\u8207\u74b0\u5883\u5b88\u885b (Invariants)</strong>\uff1a<ul>\n<li>\u6bd4\u5c0d Hunk \u4e0a\u4e0b\u6587\uff0c\u767c\u73fe\u547c\u53eb\u8005 <code>createTreeNode</code> \u8207\u88ab\u8abf\u7528\u8005 <code>deleteItemToRecycleBin</code> \u5b58\u5728\u9589\u5305\u5c4f\u969c\uff0c\u89f8\u767c <code>[!] SCOPE_ERROR</code>\u3002</li>\n<li>\u6383\u63cf\u5230 <code>window.confirm</code>\uff0c\u89f8\u767c <code>[!] HAZARD</code>\u3002</li>\n<li>\u54c1\u8cea\u9598\u9053\u4eae\u51fa\u7d05\u724c\uff1a<strong>\ud83d\udd34 \u963b\u64cb\u767c\u5e03 (BLOCKED_BY_INVARIANTS)</strong>\uff01</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"fix-commit-a1995e4\">\ud83d\udfe2 Fix Commit (<code>a1995e4</code>) \u9a57\u6536\u901a\u904e</h3>\n<div class=\"language-mysql highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n n-Quoted\">`[*] SCOPE_FIX`</span><span class=\"n\">\uff1a\u51fd\u5f0f\u81ea</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n n-Quoted\">`init()`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">\u63d0\u5347\u81f3\u9802\u5c64\u6a21\u7d44\u4f5c\u7528\u57df\u3002</span>\n\n<span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">\u79fb\u9664</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n n-Quoted\">`window.confirm`</span><span class=\"n\">\uff0c\u9577\u51fa</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">In</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">DOM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">\u6a21\u614b\u8996\u7a97</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n n-Quoted\">`#delete-confirm-modal`</span><span class=\"n\">\u3002</span>\n\n<span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">\u88dc\u9f4a\u9375\u76e4\u7121\u969c\u7919\u5c0e\u822a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n n-Quoted\">`Escape`</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n n-Quoted\">`Enter`</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">\u8207\u76e3\u807d\u5668\u92b7\u6bc0\u9632\u6d29\u6f0f\u5b88\u885b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n n-Quoted\">`cleanup()`</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"n\">\u3002</span>\n\n<span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">\u54c1\u8cea\u9598\u9053\u5224\u5b9a\uff1a</span><span class=\"o\">**</span><span class=\"err\">\ud83d\udfe2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">\u9a57\u6536\u901a\u904e</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">READY_TO_SHIP</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">**</span><span class=\"n\">\u3002</span>\n</code></pre></div></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    }
  ]
}